The best truck simulator u can find ^.^
GOOD:
- Great detailed Graphics;
- Great real driving;
- U can heard radio from streams (internet connection);
- Truck customization (Tuning);
- European Map;
- Use Ferry and ship to travel (example. France to England);
- U create your own company;
- Special events (Christmas event for exemple... Free Paint jobs ^.^ );
- U need reach a determinated lvl to bought some parts and trucks;
BAD:
- 11 modernTrucks (Scania; Volvo; Renault; MAN; Iveco; DAF; Majectic (Mercedes));
- No classic trucks;
- No American Trucks;
- No America Map;
- No Portugal/Spain (and some other countries);
- No truck damage model;
- No Multiplayer;
- U need reach a determinated lvl to bought some parts and trucks (yup, i got +- 400.000€ and i cant bought Scania V8 225.000€ because im only at lvl 11 and i need lvl 25 -.- )
VERY GOOD:
- U can fix the bad thing with MODS ^.^
(and multiplayer too).
- Sory for my bad English :P

